OL,3,GNEWSALast nurse who cared for Bradford
OL,4,ACity fire victims retires
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the last remaining working
OL,7,Fnurses who cared for people caught up
OL,8,Fin the Bradford City fire disaster is
OL,9,Fretiring after 44 years of nursing.
OL,11,FAngela O'Neill was on a day off when
OL,12,Fthe call came to help some of those
OL,13,Finjured in the tragedy which unfolded
OL,14,Fat Valley Parade in 1985.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, the 62-year-old, who has
OL,17,Fsecondary breast cancer, will work her
OL,18,Ffinal shift with colleagues at Bradford
OL,19,FRoyal Infirmary (BRI).
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
