OL,3,GNEWSALast nurse who cared for Bradford
OL,4,ACity fire victims retires
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than four decades and hundreds of
OL,7,Fpatients later, she says she will never
OL,8,Fforget her experiences on day of the
OL,9,Ffire. Following the blaze on 11 May
OL,10,F1985, 56 people died and about 265 were
OL,11,Fleft injured.
